# The floor runs the suite on Windows too. Several pins compare a committed
# file's bytes (tests/fleet_conventions.json is sha256-pinned) or read text
# a script wrote; a CRLF checkout on the Windows runner would change those
# bytes without changing the file. Every text file checks out with LF on
# every platform; binaries are detected by git and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
